IMO; for one they appear early and can spoil a game by lycanthropy,
and in case they summon more canines you cannot tell them apart, but
have to inspect the individual canines to find the [were-] "leader".
My choice would go for green were-foos (and to keep wargs[*] brown).

[*] On the NAO death list, wargs appear starting with rank 181+ (and
they contribute only to ~0.04% of all deaths). Were-foo are much more
deadly, not only by the significant(!) secondary lycanthropy effects
but also as primary death reason with ~0.50% of all deaths.

